                    coach_intro:            `Two clocks are running: peak season is coming back, and the board wants OTD at 96% and inventory at 30 days in two quarters. Don't solve last month's headline — the +38% spike was one weather-driven month on a plant that averages 78% utilization. Capacity, information and buffers have to work together so the system absorbs volatility instead of amplifying it. Show me you can tell external swing from the chaos you created.`,

